WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.670
Meet AARRKKAA International. Industrial trading, done right.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.570
One worn seal. One seized bearing. And the whole line stops.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.370
That's where we come in.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.744
Step one. Tell us what you need.

00:00:20.744 --> 00:00:24.143
Send a part number, a drawing, or just a photo on WhatsApp.

00:00:24.143 --> 00:00:26.620
You'll have a quote within one working day.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.513
Step two. We find the best source.

00:00:33.513 --> 00:00:39.202
Genuine parts from manufacturers and trusted sellers, in India and abroad.

00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:43.660
SKF from Sweden. FAG and INA from Germany. NTN from Japan.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.588
Step three. Trading is what we do.

00:00:47.588 --> 00:00:51.389
We compare sellers, buy in volume, and pass the saving on to you.

00:00:51.389 --> 00:00:53.260
So you pay less than the market.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:58.249
Step four.

00:00:58.249 --> 00:01:03.460
Every part is matched to your spec, quality checked, and packed with care, right here in Hosur.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.380
Step five. It's on the move.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:13.520
By road across India, by air when it's urgent, and by sea for export.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.000
Delivered. On time.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.364
AARRKKAA International. Genuine parts, lower cost, on time.

00:01:24.364 --> 00:01:26.530
Send us your part, and we'll match it.
